==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Dondozo|61}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion. It features a {{form|Tatsugiri|Drooopy Form}} {{p|Tatsugiri}}.
*{{m|Giga Impact}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Dondozo}} can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

